                <mxCell id="physical-note" value="Question: what does this slice add to the roster database? New table cover_request; staff is Changed with proposed qualified_ward_ids; ward and shift stay Existing.&lt;br&gt;Conventions: snake_case identifiers (not PascalCase), bigint identity keys, timestamptz. UQ enforces BR3. IX serves SC3 Requests to me.&lt;br&gt;decline_reason is personal: proposed retention 12 months, owner ward manager (Q2). Every choice is proposed. No SQL or migration. Does not test performance or safe migration." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
